              <h3><a href="/proizvodi/terarijumi/terarijum-80x50x60.html">Terarijum 80x50x60</a></h3>
              <div class="op-foot">
                <span class="op-price">Pozovite za cenu</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="op-card reveal">
            <a class="op-img" href="/proizvodi/terarijumi/terarijum-90x50x50.html">
              <img src="/style/img/terrariums/90x50x50.webp" alt="Terarijum 90x50x50" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600">
            </a>
            <div class="op-body">
              <div class="op-cat">Terarijum</div>
              <h3><a href="/proizvodi/terarijumi/terarijum-90x50x50.html">Terarijum 90x50x50</a></h3>
              <div class="op-foot">
                <span class="op-price">Pozovite za cenu</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="op-card reveal">
            <a class="op-img" href="/proizvodi/terarijumi/terarijum-60x45x50.html">
              <img src="/style/img/terrariums/60x45x50.webp" alt="Terarijum 60x45x50" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600">
            </a>
            <div class="op-body">
              <div class="op-cat">Terarijum</div>
              <h3><a href="/proizvodi/terarijumi/terarijum-60x45x50.html">Terarijum 60x45x50</a></h3>
              <div class="op-foot">
                <span class="op-price">Pozovite za cenu</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="zcta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Kontaktirajte <b>NS Reptiles</b></h2>
        <p>Za pitanja o nabavci, nezi ili opremi za kinesku vodenu agamu — tu smo. Javite nam se pozivom ili porukom.</p>
        <div class="zcta-btns">
          <a href="https://wa.me/381693301474?text=Zanima%20me%20kineska%20vodena%20agama" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--green-dark)" onclick="gtag('event','kontakt_click',{'metod':'whatsapp'})">WhatsApp</a>
          <a href="tel:+381693301474" class="btn btn-light" onclick="gtag('event','kontakt_click',{'metod':'poziv'})">+381 69 330 1474</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


</Base>
